{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22334","headline":"曲江感秋 · 白居易","name":"曲江感秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙草新雨地，岸柳凉风枝。\n三年感秋意，幷在曲江池。\n早蝉已嘹唳，晚荷复离披。\n前秋去秋思，一一生此时。\n昔人三十二，秋兴已云悲。\n我今欲四十，秋怀亦可知。\n岁月不虚设，此身随日衰。\n闇老不自觉，直到鬓成丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}